But one exception

If your assignment expects the generated .png charts or best_pipeline.joblib to be submitted, don't ignore those files.

For example:

*.png

would prevent your EDA/modeling results from being committed.

So for your assignment, I'd actually use:

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]


# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/


# Jupyter
.ipynb_checkpoints/


# Environment files
.env


# Generated databases
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
db/
chroma_db/


# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

and keep your assignment outputs tracked.
